          evolution: "The game's name identifies the 'declaration' phase as its unique selling point, separating it from the purely reactive nature of older fishing games.",
          cultural: 'In Greece, Diloti is considered a game of high skill and memory, often compared to bridge in terms of the partnership awareness required.',
